
---
const services = [
  {
    number: "01",
    title: "Discovery & Problem Definition",
    description: "Getting beneath the surface to understand the real challenge, ask better questions, and identify what matters most."
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    title: "Strategic Thinking & Decision Support",
    description: "Bringing structure to complexity, connecting evidence and insight, and helping leaders make thoughtful, informed decisions."
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    title: "Facilitation & Stakeholder Engagement",
    description: "Creating space for meaningful conversations, diverse perspectives, and the shared understanding needed to move forward."
  },
  {
    number: "04",
    title: "Change & Implementation",
    description: "Turning insight into action through practical planning, thoughtful change, and meaningful implementation."
  }
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy helps organizations navigate complexity, improve decision quality, and move forward with clarity." />
    <title>Causeway | Think deeper. Change smarter.</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="header">
      <a href="#home" class="logo">
        <img src="/causeway-logo.png" alt="Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy" />
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#thinking">The Thinking</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#approach">How I Work</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Clarity in complexity</p>
          <h1>Think deeper.<br />Change smarter.</h1>
          <p>
            Better decisions begin with better questions.<br />
            Causeway helps organizations navigate complexity, uncover what matters, and move forward with clarity and confidence.
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:kchapman@causewayconsultancy.ca" class="cta">Let's start a conversation</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intro section" id="about">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">A thoughtful way forward</p>
          <h2>Find the cause.<br />Find the way.</h2>
          <p>
            Meaningful progress starts with understanding the problem
            an organization is actually trying to solve. Through
            disciplined discovery, evidence-informed thinking, and
            meaningful stakeholder engagement, Causeway helps
            organizations make sense of complexity and find a clearer
            path forward.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="thinking section" id="thinking">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Thinking Behind the Work</p>

          <h2>Better questions lead to better decisions.</h2>

          <div class="thinking-content">
            <p>
              Causeway was founded by Krista Chapman, a registered nurse
              whose perspective on organizational challenges has been
              shaped by experience at every level of complex organizations.
            </p>

            <p>
              Beginning her career as a frontline registered nurse,
              Krista developed a firsthand understanding of service
              delivery, the realities of day-to-day operations, and the
              people behind the work. She went on to build more than
              15 years of leadership experience spanning clinical
              practice, operations, quality, strategy, and organizational
              transformation.
            </p>

            <p>
              Having worked from the frontline through to senior
              executive leadership, she understands that decisions
              made at the organizational level have real consequences
              for the people delivering and receiving services every
              day. This perspective has shaped her belief that
              meaningful improvement requires more than good intentions
              or well-designed strategies. It requires understanding
              how organizations actually work, listening to the people
              within them, and connecting the bigger picture to the
              realities on the ground.
            </p>

            <p>
              Throughout her career, Krista has worked alongside
              executive teams, multidisciplinary groups, and frontline
              professionals across Canada and the United States.
              Her experience includes navigating complex operational
              environments, leading organizational improvement
              initiatives, advancing quality and performance, and
              helping organizations make sense of change.
            </p>

            <p>
              With a Master's degree in Precision Health, specializing
              in innovation and entrepreneurship, Krista brings
              together practical experience, systems-level thinking,
              evidence-informed decision-making, and a genuine
              appreciation for the human side of organizational change.
            </p>

            <p>
              Through Causeway, Krista works alongside organizations
              and leaders to navigate complexity, uncover what matters,
              and find a clearer path forward.
            </p>

            <p class="thinking-closing">
              Because better decisions come from understanding more
              than just the problem. They come from understanding
              the people, perspectives, and systems connected to it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services section" id="services">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">How Causeway Helps</p>
          <h2>Make sense of the messy.<br />Move toward what matters.</h2>

          <div class="service-grid">
            {services.map((service) => (
              <article class="service">
                <span class="number">{service.number}</span>
                <h3>{service.title}</h3>
                <p>{service.description}</p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="approach section" id="approach">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">How I Work</p>
          <h2>Comfortable in the grey.<br />Focused on the way forward.</h2>
          <p>
            I bring curiosity, structure, and an open mind to complex
            challenges. I listen carefully, ask thoughtful questions,
            explore different perspectives, and work alongside people
            to uncover what matters. The goal isn't simply to find an
            answer. It's to make better decisions about what comes next.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact section" id="contact">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
          <h2>Have a complex challenge?<br />Let's work through it.</h2>
          <p>
            Whether you're navigating a difficult decision, exploring
            a new direction, or trying to make sense of a complex
            challenge, I'd welcome the conversation.
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:kchapman@causewayconsultancy.ca" class="cta">
            kchapman@causewayconsultancy.ca
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy Inc.</p>
      <p>Think deeper. Change smarter.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --slate: #23364A;
    --coastal: #668A9A;
    --stone: #C2BBA8;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--slate);
    background: var(--white);
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 18px 7%;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .logo img {
    display: block;
    width: 190px;
    height: auto;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--slate);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--coastal);
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 620px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 90px 10%;
    background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1448375240586-882707db888b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=85");
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(24, 42, 55, 0.82),
      rgba(24, 42, 55, 0.35)
    );
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero .eyebrow {
    color: var(--white);
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 4.5vw, 56px);
  }

  .hero p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 13px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--white);
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta:hover {
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  .section {
    padding: 100px 10%;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .intro p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .thinking {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .thinking h2 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }

  .thinking-content {
    max-width: 850px;
  }

  .thinking-content p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  .thinking-content .thinking-closing {
    margin-top: 35px;
    padding-top: 25px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  /* SERVICES */

  .service-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 65px 70px;
    margin-top: 75px;
  }

  .service {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
    padding-top: 28px;
  }

  .number {
    display: block;
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .service p {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .approach {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .approach p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .contact {
    background: var(--slate);
    color: var(--white);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact .eyebrow {
    color: var(--stone);
  }

  .contact p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 22px 7%;
    background: #1B2B3B;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  footer p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .logo img {
      width: 165px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px 18px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 560px;
      padding: 70px 8%;
      background-position: center;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 70px 8%;
    }

    .thinking-content p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .thinking-content .thinking-closing {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .service-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .number {
      font-size: 56px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .service p {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
